      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنجّح الحَاجَةَ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنجحها</span></b> , <i>He
sought, asked,</i> or <i>demanded, the accomplishment
of the want,</i> or <i>thing needed, from him who had
promised him;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَجَّزَهَا</span>. (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنجح</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اللّٰهَ</span> [<i>He sought,</i> or <i>begged, of God, success,</i> or
<i>the accomplishment of his want</i>]. (A.) See an
ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمَلٌ</span>.

